  "goodToKnow": "Die Einwohnerzahl is the population figure: Berlin hat eine Einwohnerzahl von rund 3,8 Millionen. Germany has about 84 million inhabitants, the largest population in the EU. Cities with over 100,000 inhabitants are Großstädte, of which Germany has about 80. Der Einwohner is an inhabitant, and das Einwohnermeldeamt the registration office. Die Bevölkerung means the population as people. Plural: die Einwohnerzahlen."
